OL,3,GNEWSAMother's fire ravaged home is
OL,4,Abroken into twice
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who lost her home in a fire
OL,7,Fsays intruders have broken into the
OL,8,Fproperty twice since the blaze.
OL,10,FLettisha Wyatt, from Shelfield in
OL,11,FWalsall, has spent weeks trying to
OL,12,Fsalvage what remains of her family's
OL,13,Fbelongings after a fire broke out on 27
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FNo-one was injured in the fire, but the
OL,17,Fhouse, which she shared with her two
OL,18,Fdaughters, was left uninhabitable.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
