OL,3,GNEWSAMother's fire ravaged home is
OL,4,Abroken into twice
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family's ordeal was worsened when
OL,7,Fthe property was broken into the
OL,8,Ffollowing day despite being boarded up,
OL,9,Fwith neighbours alerting the family
OL,10,Fwhen they heard someone playing their
OL,11,Fpiano.
